  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'SWORD OF DAY (Light, the ''sword'' form)

    One sword as tall as the screen falls where you aim. It leaves a crack in the ground that keeps biting.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Hold Triangle (U) to cast. 45 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
