    A sign is set on the enemy you face. Your next three weapon blows on it each set off a burst.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Hold Triangle (U) to cast. 25 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
  thing: {fileID: 1683627178}
  text: {fileID: 1676452654}
  back: {fileID: 1070021064}
  shown: {fileID: 728045147}
  lineHeight: 0.17
  letterWidth: 0.075
